WEBVTT

00:01:29.565 --> 00:01:30.729
those are gone, too.

00:01:30.753 --> 00:01:34.368
For me, those rituals are when
I gather my energy,

00:01:34.392 --> 00:01:35.918
assume my work character

00:01:35.942 --> 00:01:37.720
and get into the right headspace

00:01:37.744 --> 00:01:38.916
to dive in.

00:01:38.940 --> 00:01:41.991
So how can you recreate those breaks
and boundaries at home?

00:01:42.015 --> 00:01:43.775
The key is to be intentional.

00:01:43.799 --> 00:01:46.315
It could be music or lighting,

00:01:46.339 --> 00:01:48.321
a pep talk with a friend.

00:01:48.345 --> 00:01:51.378
You could take a walk around the block
at a certain time of day

00:01:51.402 --> 00:01:53.664
or even a breathing or stretching routine

00:01:53.688 --> 00:01:54.860
before you sit --

00:01:54.884 --> 00:01:58.385
whatever it takes for you
to delineate the transition

00:01:58.409 --> 00:02:00.123
between work and home.